  <Properties>
    <metaDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[In this post we’re going to explore the normal process that we follow when we carry out a CMS upgrade involving a platform like Sitecore, Umbraco or Optimizely.]]></Value>
    </metaDescription>
    <metaTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[what-to-expect-when-upgrading-your-content-management-system]]></Value>
    </metaTitle>
